  "description": " Beautifully Presented Fully Furnished 2-Bedroom Apartment – Kill / Straffan, Co. Kildare\n\n€1700 a month\n\nA bright, modern and beautifully presented fully furnished 2-bedroom self-contained apartment, situated in a peaceful setting between Kill and Straffan, Co. Kildare.\n\nThe apartment is located privately to the rear of the main property, with access through a gated shared entrance.\n\n Property Features\n\n* Fully self-contained 2-bedroom apartment.\n* Fully furnished to a high standard\n* Bright open-plan modern kitchen with integrated appliances and fitted units with ample storage.\n*dining and living area including Large Smart TV.\n* Two comfortable double bedrooms\n* Modern bathroom with walk in shower\n* Gated shared entrance\n* Private use of the apartment\nOne parking space free of charge\n*Wi-Fi included free of charge \n* Quiet and well-maintained setting\n\n\n*Utilities not included \n\nSuitable for lone occupancy\n\nElectricity and oil are charged separately based on an agreed proportion of the actual bills. Refuse is charged at actual collection cost.\n\n*Wi-Fi and parking are included in rent price.\n\n Location\n\nIdeally situated between Kill and Straffan, with convenient access to Naas and surrounding areas, offering a peaceful setting while remaining within easy reach of local amenities and commuter routes.\n\nAvailable to rent immediately. Rental period up until May, 2027. No Pets allowed.\n\nReferences will be required. First month rent upfront and deposit of same required. No smoking.\n",
